### Handy REST calls. Install the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) and click "Send Request".

### Debezium: connector status (look for state RUNNING on connector AND task)
GET http://localhost:8083/connectors/pg-marketplace/status

### Debezium: restart a failed task
POST http://localhost:8083/connectors/pg-marketplace/tasks/0/restart

### Flink: list jobs (state, start time)
GET http://localhost:8081/jobs/overview

### Flink: cluster overview (slots free/used)
GET http://localhost:8081/overview

### Flink: checkpoints of one job (replace the id) - watch duration, size, failures
GET http://localhost:8081/jobs/REPLACE_JOB_ID/checkpoints

### Iceberg REST: namespaces
GET http://localhost:8181/v1/namespaces

### Iceberg REST: tables in silver
GET http://localhost:8181/v1/namespaces/silver/tables

### Redpanda admin: broker health
GET http://localhost:9644/v1/cluster/health_overview

### Trino: cluster info
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/info
